w(f"Split: {F.SPLIT}. Selection rule: highest F1 on this same test set. Reproduced exactly by `scripts/run_experiments.py` (all 16 model/disease cells match to 4 d.p.; the shipped pickles give accuracy {', '.join(F.NAME[d] + ' ' + F.pct(X[d]['shipped_accuracy']) for d in F.DISEASES)}).")
