w("## 13. Base paper (for comparison; NOT a like-for-like comparison)")
w("Alam et al., IEEE Access 2026: UCI **thyroid** dataset (ann-train + ann-test merged, **7,200 samples, 21 features**, three classes Normal / Hypothyroid / Hyperthyroid; class counts as stated in the paper 6,666 / 368 / 166), five classifiers (SVC, Random Forest, Extra Trees, AdaBoost, CatBoost), **nested cross-validation** (outer stratified 5-fold, inner 3-fold grid search on accuracy), full feature set and a TOP-10 consensus set (TSH, FTI, T3, TT4, T4U, on thyroxine, query hypothyroid, psych, thyroid surgery, sex), SHAP + counterfactual explanations; Random Forest 0.996-0.997 accuracy/F1, AUC 0.999-1.000; SVC 0.965-0.967 accuracy, AUC 0.990-0.992; SMOTE tried and rejected (minority recall +<2 %); limitations: class imbalance, no external validation. Differences from this project: one disease vs four; real vs synthetic data; three-class vs binary; nested CV + tuning vs a single split with fixed settings; SHAP/counterfactual explanations vs none in the app. The project reuses the *idea* of comparing several classical classifiers with held-out evaluation and extends the scope to four diseases behind one interface; it does not reproduce the thyroid experiment.")
w()
